:" Moving average over the last four samples.

   A reference program of the static profile (docs/static-profile.md): it
   runs under KlongPy as it stands and is inside the subset that compiles to
   C. The window and the write position are state, kept between calls.

   Check it:   kgpy --check-static examples/embedded/mavg.kg
   Run it:     kgpy -l examples/embedded/mavg.kg, then step(4.0)
   Expected:   examples/embedded/mavg.expect
"

buf::[0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0]
pos::0

step::{buf::buf:=x,pos;pos::(pos+1)!#buf;(+/buf)%#buf}

.entry("step";"float -> float")
